@lrf=1|aud=LLM|scope=bootstrap
R|intent.ro|task:read-only|MUST|RO_LOCAL|answer/diagnose/review=inspect+evidence; repair=false
R|intent.rw|task:change|MUST|LW_SCOPE|requested workspace edit+proportionate checks=true
R|ctx|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|precedence=P; P=system>developer>current-task-user>reusable-user-policy; reusable-user-policy=SIGMA+routed-LRF with nearest applicable project scope; merge=compatible conjunction; equal-rank conflict=STOP+ask; invented merge=false
R|effects|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|E={RO_LOCAL,RO_PUBLIC,LW_SCOPE,EXT_WRITE,RELEASE,LIVE_WRITE,VCS_WRITE,DESTRUCT,CRED,CHARGE,PROD_DEP}; requested local reads/public reads/reversible workspace edits=ALLOW; other effects=current-task approval; unknown=STOP; credential disclosure=FORBID; explicit standing task-memory directive is scoped to mem.etl, never arbitrary live writes
R|scope|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|unrelated changes=preserve; destructive target=resolve exact; project rules=nearest project source
R|host|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|os=Windows11; shell=PowerShell7; deny=Bash/sh/GitBash/WSL unless explicit; exec=native+.exe; all-file-discovery=rg.exe; text=UTF8-noBOM
R|legacy|*|MUST_NOT|RO_LOCAL|activate imported-gemini/archive/backups/legacy hooks
R|route.phase|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|effect decision first; decision!=ALLOW=>conditional leaf count=0
R|route.tags|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|after ALLOW collect all: code=software create/edit/refactor/design; doc=README/docs create/edit or SKILL.md contract scan/repair; state=basename in {decisions.md,method.md,knowledge.md,issues.md,memo.md,history.md,diary.md} applies/touched/requested-create; worker=task has CODE stage or bounded worker selection; subagent=Codex subagent invocation or subagent configuration work; after AGENT_ROUTER selection add exactly one engine tag: agy=worker-agy, llama=worker-llama; hydrate only selected engine skill
R|route.order|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|matching leaf union once: state>engineering>documentation
R|bootstrap.next|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|after bootstrap read rules/README-forLLM.md for bounded LRF lookup and sequence navigation; then hydrate only matching MANUAL.lrf and LOAD.lrf records
L|bootstrap.manual|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|[manual](MANUAL.lrf)
L|bootstrap.load|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|[load](LOAD.lrf)
R|workflow.default|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|default sequence=../etl/main.seq; entry=PRECEDENT; change path=research.seq -> change.seq -> finish.seq; local evidence path=research-local.seq; applicable phases in order PRECEDENT->RESEARCH->PLAN->PRE_VERIFY->CODE->POST_VERIFY->FINISH; read-only task and bounded LOCAL_REVIEW bypass change stages and still run FINISH; do not skip applicable gates
R|agent.mode|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|Codex subagents require explicit task authorization or applicable delegation instruction and no current prohibition; permit root→child→grandchild delegation only when runtime actually supports it (depth<=2, deny great-grandchildren); user prohibits Codex subagents=>main performs research/plan/preverify/postverify serially; Astra is leaf-only and MUST_NOT invoke another subagent; CODE starts with one AGENT_ROUTER-selected worker by comparable measured context consumption or dated nonnormative fallback; agy only on separate explicit current-task request and non-recursive; one-writer-per-file; wait for actual requested results and verify before synthesis; correction-cycles<=3
R|agent.gates|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|substantial=multi-file behavior/API/schema/security/concurrency/migration/difficult rollback; unstable fact=>dated primary evidence+fact/inference/unknown; pre=>plan audit PASS; post=>real diff/snapshot+deterministic checks; independent auditor/verifier only when agent.mode permits; otherwise main performs separate checks and explicitly reports lack of independent review
R|mem.etl|*|MUST|LIVE_WRITE|every task stop, including read-only and blocked tasks, prepare bounded task Markdown with category+task_id-specific titles and ingest each generated report once through configured llm-mem; standing user directive=mandatory task-memory ingest, no repeated confirmation; higher-priority restriction or tool failure=>FAILED+report, never fabricated success or silent N_A; unrelated DB writes, survey submission, external mirrors, credential changes and VCS remain separately gated
R|done|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|confirm behavior+non-change scope+checks+changed files+residual risk; execute mem.etl and report actual receipt or FAILED; secrets/raw logs excluded; ETL failure=>warn+report
